<h1 style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;line-height:1.25;color:#0a0a0a;">
  Confirm account deletion
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 22px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5ba60b;">
  Action required
</p>

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  Hi {{name}},
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  We received a request to permanently delete the Dukka account for <strong>{{email}}</strong>. To continue, confirm with the verification code below.
</p>

{{> code-box label="Deletion confirmation code" value=token}}

<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">
  This code expires in <strong>{{expiresInSeconds}} seconds</strong>. Once confirmed, your account and associated data will be scheduled for deletion according to our policies.
</p>

{{#> tip title="Changed your mind?"}}
  If you did not request deletion, ignore this email and your account will remain active. We recommend reviewing your security settings if this request was unexpected.
{{/tip}}

<p style="margin:0;">
  We are sorry to see you consider leaving — your confirmation keeps the process intentional and secure.
</p>
